{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Antediluvian: Seed in Peril&quot; starts as a Roguelite that takes place in a world full of hungry Nephilim giants, vicious hybridized creatures, and enemies of a paranormal nature.\u00a0 The beautiful Naamah has been captured and imprisoned by the confused populace of Atlantis, intending to sacrifice her to one of the few surviving titans.\u00a0 Time is running out, and Noah must act swiftly to save his true love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey as Noah through the land and collect all of the Sigils of Creation.\u00a0 Harness their supernatural abilities and wield their strength to rescue Naamah from the mouth of the titan.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3094760?t=1770842112","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094760/9f524c652f79b5f0683276af53b34f399df977bf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770842112","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094760/3e4deda0c92db3f673181abb1a4ded52890c7703/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770842112","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094760/3e4deda0c92db3f673181abb1a4ded52890c7703/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770842112","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,4,5],"notes":"The giant enemy types are extremely savage and are too busy constantly finding food to bother to craft/wear clothing.  In instances where these enemies are encountered, male nudity is displayed on screen.\r\n\r\nThe game is planned to launch with maturity settings to turn off visible genitalia, effectively making the giants genderless, showing only male buttocks.\r\n\r\nMost enemy types are violent and bloodthirsty.  Most violent acts will be experienced in combat with them.\r\n\r\n"},"demos":[{"appid":3682870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"